      "mergeID": "698cb0026c855a1ccca3ab95",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When sent a sticker or emoji there is a chance that it will just be a white rectangle. When this happens you can't see the sticker or emoji in the wheel or inventory, but when you use them it works just fine, but this makes stickers harder to use since the overlay that you use is also the white rectangle. \n\nThere is a workaround for anyone having this issue \n\nif you open your inventory, click on one of the stickers that is just a white rectangle, and hit edit\n\nthen hit next until it saves \n\nit should fix it\n\nevery once in a while I have to do it twice but it generally works",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[Stickers/Emojis] Sent stickers/emojis not rendering in inventory or wheel",
