  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Get a user to share an emoji/sticker  pedastle or directly to you \n\n2. Go into your inventory or add the image to your custom radial menu emoji/sticker section\n\nYou should now see the sticker / emoji has appeared as a white rectangle that perfectly shows when used or placed. \n\nThere is a current work around for this,\n\n1. Go into your inventory and click on the sticker/emoji and click edit \n\n2. Keep pressing the next button and then finally save \n\nYou should see that the emoji/sticker is now correctly showing, You will have to replace this back in the radial slot you wanted.",
